      "id": 4,
      "text": "Doylesburg lies in Path Valley, a narrow Appalachian valley flanked by Kittatinny Ridge to the northwest and Tuscarora Mountains to the southeast.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
